          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does pickup take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Scheduling depends on project size, loading needs, and equipment type. Same-week pickup may be available for qualifying Bakersfield projects. Larger office moves, warehouse cleanouts, or multi-department collections can require additional coordination before a pickup date is confirmed."
